Ravana camps on Kailasa under moonlight --- Ravana lusts seeing adorned Rambha crossing camp --- Ravana seizes hand and propositions world lordship --- Rambha pleads status as son Nalakubara wife --- Ravana scorns plea and assaults Rambha forcibly --- Rambha falls at Nalakubara feet reporting assault --- Nalakubara curses head to split sevenfold for unwilling assault --- Gods rejoice and Ravana shuns unwilling women
